{"attack":"向对手猛烈地发射种子进行攻击。连续攻击2~5次。","description":"攻击目标造成伤害，一回合内连续攻击2～5次。命中时，各有15%的几率攻击5或4次，35%的几率攻击3或2次，攻击次数的数学期望是3.1次，对应的威力的数学期望是77.5。\n携带机变骰子且命中时，各有1⁄2的几率攻击5或4次，攻击次数的数学期望是4.5次，对应的威力的数学期望是112.5。\n每一击击中要害的概率都相等。\n如果某一下触发了目标的气势披带、气势头带、结实特性或打破了替身，招式会继续攻击。\n忍耐、金属爆炸和双倍奉还只计算最后一次的伤害。\n如果使用者持有王者之证或锐利之牙，或具有恶臭特性，每一下攻击都有相同的概率造成对手畏缩。\n如果目标拥有咒术之躯、碎裂铠甲特性，每一下攻击都会触发效果。即使特性发动令攻击方陷入一些可能无法行动的状态（如麻痹、畏缩、着迷、定身法状态），也不会影响本次攻击，但陷入睡眠和濒死时攻击即刻停止。\n目标的变色特性在最后一下攻击完成后才发动。","levelUpMoves":[{"Name":"Voltorb form:hisuian","Level":9},{"Name":"Electrode form:hisuian","Level":9},{"Name":"Exeggcute","Level":30},{"Name":"Exeggutor","Level":0},{"Name":"Exeggutor form:alolan","Level":0},{"Name":"Hoppip","Level":12},{"Name":"Skiploom","Level":15},{"Name":"Jumpluff","Level":15},{"Name":"Sunflora","Level":25},{"Name":"Remoraid","Level":28},{"Name":"Octillery","Level":30},{"Name":"Mantine","Level":0},{"Name":"Cacnea","Level":16},{"Name":"Cacturne","Level":16},{"Name":"Cinccino","Level":0},{"Name":"Pumpkaboo","Level":20},{"Name":"Gourgeist","Level":20},{"Name":"Pikipek","Level":31},{"Name":"Trumbeak","Level":37},{"Name":"Toucannon","Level":40},{"Name":"Skwovet","Level":35},{"Name":"Greedent","Level":41},{"Name":"Appletun","Level":20},{"Name":"Morpeko form:fullbelly","Level":45},{"Name":"Morpeko form:hangry","Level":45},{"Name":"Tandemaus","Level":18},{"Name":"Maushold form:family_four","Level":18},{"Name":"Maushold form:family_three","Level":18},{"Name":"Bramblin","Level":13},{"Name":"Brambleghast","Level":13},{"Name":"Capsakid","Level":21},{"Name":"Scovillain","Level":21},{"Name":"Dipplin","Level":20}],"tutorMoves":[],"eggMoves":["Patrat","Watchog","Pansage","Simisage"],"trMoves":[],"hmMoves":[],"transferMoves":["Paras","Parasect","Bellsprout","Weepinbell","Victreebel","Chikorita","Bayleef","Meganium","Sunkern","Grovyle","Sceptile","Shroomish","Breloom","Gulpin","Swalot","Cacnea","Cacturne","Tropius","Turtwig","Grotle","Torterra","Wormadam form:plant","Wormadam form:sandy","Wormadam form:trash","Carnivine",